#. module: ssi_school_customer_invoice_export_operating_unit
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_customer_invoice_export_operating_unit.field_school_enrollment_wizard_create_invoice_export__operating_unit_id
msgid ""
"Operating unit this export is being run for. Only invoices belonging to this "
"operating unit are exported, and it is propagated to the resulting "
"customer_invoice_export document. Defaults to the acting user's own default "
"operating unit, not the operating unit of the selected enrollment(s), since "
"the selection may span more than one operating unit."
msgstr "Unit operasi tempat ekspor ini dijalankan. Hanya faktur milik unit operasi ini yang diekspor, dan nilainya diteruskan ke dokumen customer_invoice_export yang dihasilkan. Secara default memakai unit operasi default pengguna yang menjalankan, bukan unit operasi dari pendaftaran yang dipilih, karena pilihan dapat mencakup lebih dari satu unit operasi."
